WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.020 --> 00:00:05.140
Hello CZsWorld.

00:00:05.140 --> 00:00:12.140
Happy Holidays. By the time you're watching this it will be Christmas which means only 341 days until Halloween.

00:00:12.140 --> 00:00:17.100
In honor of this holiday season, a couple friends and I decided to do a YouTube horror channel gift exchange,

00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:20.600
and my package from How Bizarre has finally arrived.

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:23.020
So I'm going to do a little unboxing.

00:00:23.440 --> 00:00:26.800
First we got this note: "Do not open before X-mas".

00:00:27.180 --> 00:00:30.860
We're planning to upload these videos on the 25th so...

00:00:30.860 --> 00:00:33.800
I'm not really sure what you want me to do, I'm gonna have to open this one way or another.

00:00:37.300 --> 00:00:40.660
Look at this, the moment I cut into that thing I just feel this sharp pain cutting into my wrist.

00:00:40.660 --> 00:00:42.880
--no idea what is going--

00:00:54.020 --> 00:00:58.820
No way! I used to love this thing when I was a kid! This is going to be great!

00:00:59.460 --> 00:01:02.340
How Bizarre: YOU SHOULDN'T HAVE DONE THAT.

00:01:09.520 --> 00:01:12.160
Let this be a cautionary tale to you all.

00:01:12.540 --> 00:01:15.140
NEVER open before Christmas.

00:01:15.600 --> 00:01:21.600
Also, be sure to like this video and comment what your favorite holiday gift was this year.

00:01:22.200 --> 00:01:25.240
DO NOT forget to subscribe.

00:01:25.240 --> 00:01:29.320
Click here to see the present that I sent to Superfreak Media.

00:01:30.100 --> 00:01:33.860
Be sure to subscribe to both Superfreak and How Bizarre.

00:01:34.040 --> 00:01:36.600
You will not receive another warning.

00:02:00.200 --> 00:02:01.720
Oh, you're still here.

00:02:07.280 --> 00:02:11.120
I just wanted to say thank you for making 2015 a great year.

00:02:11.280 --> 00:02:16.640
You guys, the fans, are really what make CZsWorld into a thing; make it possible.

00:02:17.120 --> 00:02:19.360
So thank you so much for watching.

00:02:19.360 --> 00:02:22.920
We had a really great year this year, we did Hello Darkness, Final Set...

00:02:22.920 --> 00:02:26.260
a bunch of short films and everyone's new favorite thing, Microhorror.

00:02:26.260 --> 00:02:30.500
And stick around for 2016 because there's a lot of big things planned for then too.

00:02:30.700 --> 00:02:32.220
Just a word of caution,

00:02:32.220 --> 00:02:35.260
be careful. Have a safe holidays, because...

00:02:35.260 --> 00:02:38.320
if you're using a box cutter to open your presents like I did...

00:02:38.320 --> 00:02:39.760
they tend to be sharp,

00:02:40.400 --> 00:02:43.440
and while this may not have been real blood...

00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:47.440
this might have been, so have a safe holiday season.

00:02:47.440 --> 00:02:49.600
Use caution with sharp objects.

00:02:49.600 --> 00:02:51.840
So that's all I got for you in 2015.

00:02:51.840 --> 00:02:55.680
Please check out Superfreak's video, you're definitely going to want to see what I sent to him.

00:02:55.680 --> 00:02:58.160
I'll see you on the other side in 2016.

00:03:02.800 --> 00:03:04.340
Grandma's Cookies sure are good.

